---
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about__image-col">
    <div class="about__img-main">
      <img src="/images/safari-drive.png" alt="Safari vehicle on red dust track in the Serengeti" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div class="about__img-accent">
      <img src="/images/maasai-guide.png" alt="Maasai guide at sunset on the savanna" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div class="about__badge">
      <span class="about__badge-num">15</span>
      <span class="about__badge-text">Years leading<br/>expeditions in Africa</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="about__content">
    <span class="section-label">Who We Are</span>
    <h2>Born from a love<br />of wild Africa</h2>

    <p>
      HAO Expedition & Safari was founded by a small team of naturalists and wilderness guides who spent decades living and working across East Africa's most remote landscapes. We built this company around one conviction: the best safaris are led by people who are genuinely in love with the land.
    </p>

    <p>
      Our guides are fluent in the rhythms of the bush — they know where the elephants drink at midday, where the leopards sleep when it's hot, and which ridge catches the light at golden hour. They share that knowledge the way a friend would, not a tour operator.
    </p>

    <div class="about__values">
      <div class="about__value">
        <div class="about__value-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none">
            <path d="M14 3C14 3 5 8 5 16a9 9 0 0 0 18 0C23 8 14 3 14 3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M14 12v4M14 20v1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Conservation First</h4>
          <p>A portion of every booking funds community conservation programmes across our operating areas.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about__value">
        <div class="about__value-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none">
            <circle cx="14" cy="14" r="11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M14 8v6l4 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Fully Tailored</h4>
          <p>No fixed departure dates. Every itinerary is built around your schedule, pace, and passions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about__value">
        <div class="about__value-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none">
            <path d="M14 4l2.47 7.6H24l-6.24 4.53 2.38 7.34L14 19.08 7.86 23.47l2.38-7.34L4 11.6h7.53L14 4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Small Groups Only</h4>
          <p>We limit all groups to preserve the integrity of wildlife encounters and the wilderness itself.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a href="#contact" class="btn-gold">Meet Our Team</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    min-height: 680px;
  }

  /* ---- Image column ---- */
  .about__image-col {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--green-deep);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about__img-main {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }

  .about__img-main img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .about__img-accent {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 2.5rem;
    right: -1.5rem;
    width: 180px;
    height: 240px;
    border: 4px solid var(--ivory);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }

  .about__img-accent img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about__badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 2.5rem;
    left: 2.5rem;
    background: var(--gold);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .about__badge-num {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--green-deep);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .about__badge-text {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--green-deep);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* ---- Content column ---- */
  .about__content {
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem) clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    background: var(--ivory);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about__content h2 {
    color: var(--green-deep);
  }

  .about__content p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 50ch;
  }

  .about__values {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .about__value {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .about__value-icon {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--green-forest);
    color: var(--gold);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .about__value h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--green-deep);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .about__value p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .about__image-col {
      height: 380px;
    }
    .about__img-accent {
      right: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
